VERDICT
====================================================================
  native 6-level : 72.4% accuracy, 63.5% macro-F1, +22.8 lift
  3-band product : 80.0% accuracy, 76.6% macro-F1, +20.2 lift
  collapsing 6->3 moves accuracy +7.6 points and lift -2.6

  Lift is the honest comparison. Accuracy always rises when classes merge,
  because merging removes errors without the model improving.
